 # NIGHT PARADE
 
-Interactive living handscroll project.
+An interactive living handscroll in which light pins a yōkai back into its historical image and darkness lets the ink rise into layered motion.
 
 ## Current gate
 
-Asset Gate 01 — Green Monkey extraction and rig preparation.
+**Gate 01 V02 — Lantern Hero**
 
-Do not scaffold the full experience or install rendering libraries until the approved implementation brief is added to `docs/gates/`.
+Only the green-monkey hero is active. The goal is to prove the signature light/dark rule before expanding the project.
 
-## Repository rule
+## Run
 
-- Source scans and licenses live in `docs/sources/`.
-- Runtime-ready assets live in `public/art/`.
-- Work-in-progress screenshots and captures live in `artifacts/`.
-- Each scene is isolated under `src/experience/scenes/`.
+```bash
+npm run check
+npm run dev
+```
+
+Open:
+
+```text
+http://127.0.0.1:4173/
+```
+
+## Current implementation
+
+- zero runtime dependencies;
+- direct WebGL 2 full-screen shader;
+- exact source image + user-prepared clean plate;
+- nine high-resolution anatomical region weights;
+- independent layered transforms and contact shadows;
+- pointer, touch, mobile crop, and reduced motion;
+- public-domain source records under `docs/sources/`.
+
+## Gate rule
+
+Do not add the full scroll, more creatures, audio, backend, navigation, or loading architecture until Gate 01 passes visual review.
+
+Review instructions: `docs/gates/GATE_01_REVIEW.md`.
